1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,096
Regarde cette robe !
Look at this dress!

2
00:00:03,596 --> 00:00:05,636
Elle est très jolie !
It's very pretty!

3
00:00:06,136 --> 00:00:08,416
Je peux l'essayer ?
Can I try it on?

4
00:00:08,916 --> 00:00:10,812
Bien sûr !
Of course!

5
00:00:11,312 --> 00:00:14,792
Excusez-moi, combien coûte cette robe ?
Excuse me, how much is this dress?

6
00:00:15,292 --> 00:00:17,524
Elle coûte trente euros.
It costs thirty euros.

7
00:00:18,024 --> 00:00:20,304
C'est un peu cher.
It's a little expensive.

8
00:00:20,804 --> 00:00:24,644
Et cette jupe ? Elle est moins chère.
What about this skirt? It's cheaper.

9
00:00:25,144 --> 00:00:28,744
Bonne idée ! Je la prends !
Good idea! I'll take it!

